BT 1 0 0 1 0 97 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The Executive Board will remain rigid in terms of the Rules of Procedure, and will refrain from interrupting) Tj T* (the flow of debate. The responsibility of deciding and altering the flow of committee is in your hands, the) Tj T* (delegates. To do so, you will have to be thorough with the RoP, so please read the RoP mentioned in the) Tj T* (background guide adequately. We encourage you to approach this conference not as a competition, but as a) Tj T* (learning experience that will help you gain new connections, learn invaluable concepts, and understand the) Tj T* (world of international relations better. Lastly, if you have any queries, do not hesitate to contact the) Tj T* (Executive Board through email.) Tj T* ET
