BT 1 0 0 1 0 60 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 14.3 TL (Delegates use directives to wield their portfolio powers, which are distinct to each delegate and define the) Tj T* -0.043876 Tw (reach of their directives. For instance, a State may direct its foreign ministry to request an emergency special) Tj T* 0 Tw (session, deploy a fact-finding team, impose national export controls, or coordinate with allies on a request) Tj T* (for an advisory opinion. Directives can go beyond traditional roles to pursue national objectives; all such) Tj T* (actions must be executed through directives.) Tj T* ET
