BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (We are delighted to welcome you to the United Nations General Assembly \(UNGA\) at OAKMUN 2026, where) Tj T* (we are committed to ensuring a smooth and efficient committee flow during the three days of conference.) Tj T* (As the Executive Board, we are excited to see you represent your respective nations and work together to) Tj T* (develop resolutions and form a consensus on the question that we will be deliberating upon. As a delegate,) Tj T* (you will be putting your negotiation prowess, diplomacy, critical thinking abilities, and knowledge of) Tj T* (international law to the ultimate test. Alongside that, you will have your hands full tackling moderated) Tj T* (caucuses during formal sessions and handling the rest of the committee during the chaotic unmoderated) Tj T* (caucuses.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
