BT 1 0 0 1 0 81.5 Tm /F3+0 11.5 Tf 15.5 TL (In order to provide you a solid grasp of the agenda and to help you get started on your conference research,) Tj T* (we have put together this background guide. It is imperative that you do not use this background guide as) Tj T* (your only source of information for the duration of the conference's research. It is advised that you use it to) Tj T* (gain a foundational understanding before expanding your knowledge through independent study, especially) Tj T* (the primary documents named in the guide \(Charter text, ICJ judgments, letters to the Security Council, and) Tj T* (your own State's statements\).) Tj T* ET
